# Practice Writing Tests

## Entry
- Home → Practice Writing → catalog
- Hub: `PracticeWritingHub.tsx`
- Catalog: `practiceWritingCatalog.ts`
- Models folder: `practiceWritingModels.ts` (not a fifth test)

## Test 1 (Outdoor activities · graph)
- Data: `practiceWritingTest1.ts` · Session: `PracticeWritingTest1Session.tsx`
- Graph: SVG `OutdoorActivitiesGraph.tsx`
- **Learn** — discuss → rank → graph explore → T/F → model fill → write → follow-up
- **Exam** — write → checklist → sample → results

## Test 2 (Online shopping · process)
- Data: `practiceWritingTest2.ts` · Session: `PracticeWritingTest2Session.tsx`
- Diagram asset: `practice-writing-test2-process.png`
- **Learn** — discuss → vocab (1B 2E 3D 4F 5C 6A) → passive notice → transforms → structure order C→A→B → plan → write (15 min tip) → descriptors (1C 2B 3D 4A) → peer feedback
- **Exam** — process write → checklist → sample → results
- Teacher keys + sample answer from teacher book

## Test 3 (Travel & tourism · Task 2 cause/effect)
- Data: `practiceWritingTest3.ts` · Session: `PracticeWritingTest3Session.tsx`
- Lead-in: `practice-writing-test3-airport.png`
- **Learn** — discuss → prep gaps (for/about/on…) → cause-effect words → brainstorm table → intro = Q3 → intro roles A4 B1 C2 D3 → thesis A1 B4 C2 → plan tips → write tourism essay → sample
- **Exam** — Task 2 write (~40 min) → checklist → sample → results
- Write prompt: effects of tourism on local communities · sample from teacher book

## Test 4 (Technology & the elderly · Task 2 problem–solution)
- Data: `practiceWritingTest4.ts` · Session: `PracticeWritingTest4Session.tsx`
- Lead-in: `practice-writing-test4-elderly.png`
- **Learn** — discuss → task keywords → recommendation stems → softening (while it is true that / complex issue / despite…) → sort ideas P/S/A/D → mini paragraph → plan table → write → sample
- **Exam** — Task 2 write (~40 min) → checklist → sample → results
- Teacher chains: 4→2→8→3 and 6→7→1→5 · full sample from teacher book

## Models (separate folder)
- Data: `practiceWritingModels.ts` · UI: `PracticeWritingModels.tsx`
- Hub catalog → **Models** → Task 1 graphs (bar/pie/table/map/mixed) + Task 2 essays (7 types) + linking
- Task 2 types: discuss both · agree/disagree · problem–solution · why+effects · advantages outweigh · positive/negative development · why + what governments can do
- Each part: phrases · **Нужно** (must be in this paragraph) · **Нельзя** (typical mistakes) · example. Own ideas, whole frame in order.
- Task 1 pages also show the chart, **Обычно** (what this type describes), **Вставить** (what to plug in)
- Read-only hard sample; not mixed into Tests 1–4
- **No leftover scrollbar** on the Models folder or chart page if the viewport still has empty space. Compact cards/charts instead of `overflow: auto`. See `no-useless-scroll.mdc`.

## Results / stats
- Reuse `PracticeReadingResults`
- Skills: `task-1-graph`, `task-1-process`, `task-2-essay`
